cifs: invalidate cfid on unlink/rename/rmdir

jira KERNEL-1825
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-5.14.0-687.61.1.el9_8
commit-author Shyam Prasad N <sprasad@microsoft.com>
commit f71d68d2b473e47db260c27c98212829590d8bae
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-5.14.0-687.61.1.el9_8/f71d68d2.failed

Today we do not invalidate the cached_dirent or the entire
parent cfid when a dentry in a dir has been removed/moved.

This change invalidates the parent cfid so that we don't serve
directory contents from the cache.

	Cc: <stable@vger.kernel.org>
	Signed-off-by: Shyam Prasad N <sprasad@microsoft.com>
	Signed-off-by: Steve French <stfrench@microsoft.com>
(cherry picked from commit f71d68d2b473e47db260c27c98212829590d8bae)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

